# Copy to <environment>.secrets and chmod 600. rc refuses to read it if others can.
# Cloudflare API token: permissions Zone:Zone:Read and Zone:DNS:Edit, restricted to the one zone.
# Caddy uses it to answer ACME DNS challenges for the wildcard certificate.
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
# Fine-grained GitHub token, read-only "Contents" on the repository, so hosts can download releases.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
